<title>GERMANY: Gagging order on Telekom analysts to end.</title>
<headline>Gagging order on Telekom analysts to end.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The agreement by telecom analysts at banks involved in the flotation of Deutsche Telekom not to publish analyses on the company runs out on Friday, a spokesman for Germany's Deutsche Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The public offering of the incumbent telephone giant in November involved most of Germany's financial sector either as flotation coordinators or members of the banking consortium backing the issue.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +40 69 756525</p>
</text>
